+
+**Current status: active; not ready for submission.** No remote publication or submission is authorized by this goal.
+
+| Milestone | Status | Evidence / next action |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1. Baseline, scope, eligibility, environment | In progress | Author facts and fresh wheel verified; current submission/review/format/AI requirements now checked and linked in the requirements checklist. Support matrix and public-history/research evidence remain. |
