+| 4. Reproducible compatibility experiment | In progress | Frozen 34,908 cases and 32,451 rescues. Analytical runtime preflight and separate-outcome runner verified; full 67,359-fixture ngspice 42 run completed and 650,116 retained artifacts were verified. Binding/dependency audit, current reference, multi-analysis, evaluation grouping and final reporting remain. |
+| 5. Fair benchmarks | Pending | Measurement boundary, status/correctness checks, paired large cases, sampling and output generation repairs remain. |
+| 6. Documentation and positioning | In progress | Corrected sensitivity scope and removed automatic Gear switching and stale certification counts from capabilities/roadmap. MES noise source and finite reference coverage documented; stale TODO removed. Original audit correction retained. Full source-by-source review remains. |
+| 7. Manuscript and release candidate | Pending external facts and engineering | Manuscript, citations, figures, PDF, actual research use and human checks remain. |
+
+**Requirements checked 2026-09-10**
+
+| Requirement | Evidence / outstanding work |
