+research workflow, manuscript/PDF and release package. Human eligibility and
+review information remains pending. The full seven-milestone goal stays active.
+
+**Checkpoint 11 — September 10, 2026 (historical)**
+
+- Added `tools/kicad_experiment.py freeze/verify`. Input generation runs without
+  simulators, requires the pinned clean corpus, refuses existing output directories,
+  hashes the source inventory and generated assets, and detects changes during
+  generation. Declaration IDs distinguish kind, lexical scope and occurrence.
+- Preserved the full historical cohort: **34,908 cases**, exactly equal as a
+  file/kind/name/info multiset to the audit's JSON, with zero additions/omissions.
+  Planned **34,908 primary + 32,451 isolated/driven fixtures** before outcomes;
+  six subcircuits have recorded isolation-generation failures.
+- Inventory exposes **34,764 distinct primary fixture byte sequences**, the
+  **169 excess old file/name-key occurrences**, and **652 cases with recorded
+  lexical scopes**. Those annotations do not prove ngspice name resolution;
+  duplicate/nested/malformed vendor declarations still require a binding audit.
